<urn:atm:triage:finding/ATM-QA-005>
  a triage:Finding ;
  triage:findingId "ATM-QA-005" ;
  triage:title "SocketEndpointGuard drop ordering not enforced by Rust field rules" ;
  triage:description "crates/atm-daemon/src/local_ipc_transport.rs:195-215 — SocketEndpointGuard drop ordering is assumed but not enforced by Rust field declaration order. Panic safety not guaranteed. Fix: document the required drop order with a comment, or restructure fields so Rust's guaranteed FIFO field-drop order enforces the invariant." ;
